Ла Лига от Sports.ru для iOS - это вся информация о чемпионате Испании по футболу сегодня! 

Приложение включает: 

• Все свежие новости о клубах чемпионата Испании из более чем 700 источников; 
• Освещение всех игр и событий сезона; 
• Полная информация о трансферах; 
• Полная статистика всех матчей чемпионата в режиме реального времени, а также статистика игроков; 
• Текстовые онлайн трансляции всех матчей, календарь чемпионата Испании и турнирная таблица; 
• Интервью, репортажи и мнения экспертов; 
• Галереи с яркими и актуальными фото; 
• Блоги и материалы пользователей о чемпионате Испании; 
• Широкие возможности для общения с другими 
болельщиками команды.

Tallinn 2023 app is a free mobile application designed with an idea to digitalize the experience of participation on European Fencing Championship for Cadets and Juniors - Tallinn 2023.

Through app users would be able to:

- digitalize the plastic accreditation card;
- speed up and track the control equipment process with a real-time data;
- follow all related news and information like a daily schedule, bus schedule, live results, etc...

Soccer Improved: your pocket-sized soccer coach for all skill levels. Set goals, receive personalized training plans, and access a vast library of exercises. Customize training based on equipment, track progress with skill tests, and enhance your game knowledge. Upgrade to PRO for exclusive content. Train smarter, play better!


// Personalized training plans
Receive tailor-made training plans designed to help you achieve your main goal and subgoals, ensuring optimal progress.

// 1000 exercises
Choose from a vast library of nearly 1000 soccer drills, covering various skills and techniques to keep your training fresh and engaging.

// Track your improvement
Regularly assess your soccer abilities through skill tests, allowing you to monitor your progress and fine-tune your training plan.

// ​​Set 1 main goal and 2 subgoals
Define your primary objective and two supporting goals to create a focused path towards soccer success.

// For everyone
Whether you’re a beginner, intermediate, or advanced player, Soccer Improved caters to all skill levels and ambitions.

// Don’t worry about equipment
Indicate which equipment you have (to get the right exercises): Input your available equipment to receive customized exercises that work best with your resources.

// Knowledge videos
Enhance your understanding of the game with informative videos, covering topics like tactics, strategies, and soccer-specific fitness.

